WEBVTT

00:00:59.472 --> 00:01:03.101
which is close to 40 percent
of global carbon emissions.

00:01:03.142 --> 00:01:04.352
So in that space,

00:01:04.393 --> 00:01:07.980
we’re putting a lot of materials,
like flooring, into buildings.

00:01:08.523 --> 00:01:12.151
When we started
on sustainability as a company,

00:01:12.151 --> 00:01:16.656
most of these products
had a significant impact on the planet.

00:01:16.697 --> 00:01:20.076
We wasted a lot of resources,
we recycled nothing,

00:01:20.076 --> 00:01:21.577
and they had a carbon footprint

00:01:21.577 --> 00:01:24.247
that we had never
even measured or understood.

00:01:24.288 --> 00:01:25.998
Interface became inspired

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:29.669
to take the company
in a more sustainable direction.

